The game froze once when I exited a (quest-)game. I tried to reproduce
the error, but had no success. The only info I can give you about the
freeze is what was printed on the console afterwards. I hope it helps
you a bit.  (I tried to kill the game, but it didn't work, so I had to
use kill -9)

[The standard GGI messages]
