Linux kbd: couldn't restore mode: Bad file descriptor
Linux kbd: tcseattr failed: Bad file descriptor
Terminating on signal 2
Linux kbd: couldn't restore mode: Bad file descriptor
Linux kbd: tcseattr failed: Bad file descriptor
Killed
